WEBVTT

00:08:28.862 --> 00:08:33.520
that violence isn't inherent in one's religion or race,

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:36.433
and the son does not have to follow

00:08:36.433 --> 00:08:39.515
the ways of his father.

00:08:39.515 --> 00:08:42.305
I am not my father.

00:08:42.305 --> 00:08:45.205
Thank you. (Applause)

00:08:45.205 --> 00:08:48.864
Thank you, everybody. (Applause)

00:08:48.864 --> 00:08:51.504
Thank you all. (Applause)

00:08:51.504 --> 00:08:55.504
Thanks a lot. (Applause)